WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Introducing UNCX Vesting V2, a flexible and secure way to manage token distribution over time.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.000
With Vesting V2, you can choose from multiple vesting curves.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Linear, a gradual release over time.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Cliff, tokens unlock only after a set period.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Monthly unlock, regular predictable releases.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Intervals, custom timeframes that fit your project needs.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Each vesting schedule is represented as an NFT, giving you verifiable ownership.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
You can transfer ownership to another wallet,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
cancel the vesting if needed, or add more tokens to an existing stream.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Vesting V2 also supports mass airdrops with vesting curves,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
whether linear, in-steps, or with a single unlock.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
And you can upload your token distribution data via CSV files for efficiency.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Every parameter is fully customisable, allowing you to match your distribution model to your community and project goals.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
UNCX Vesting V2, a complete, flexible toolkit for token release management.
